<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gusti Ngurah Agung</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1906</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Gusti Ngurah Agung was the last raja of the Balinese kingdom of Tabanan. In 1906, after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> conquest of Badung and its puputan, Dutch troops advanced on Tabanan and he surrendered. Facing exile, he took his own life in captivity together with his son, and Tabanan was annexed to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/east-indies">Dutch East Indies</a>.</p></div>
